   "provenance_turn": 14,
   "span_start": 81
  },
  {
   "id": "15:83",
   "text": "Firstly, always start your variable names with 'n_'.",
   "key": "new:15:83",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 15,
   "span_start": 83
  },
  {
   "id": "15:136",
   "text": "This helps maintain consistency and makes the code more readable.",
   "key": "new:15:136",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 15,
   "span_start": 136
  },
  {
   "id": "16:0",
   "text": "Secondly, for all functions, add the '@retry' decorator from the 'pedantic' module.",
   "key": "new:16:0",
   "scope": "MAIN",
